[R1] SCALE-INVARIANCE of the via-Vmax ratio  W(S\{Vmax})*7*Vmax
============================================================================
  via-Vmax ratio invariant under common scaling on 8 random pairs: True
  PROVED: G_{gS}(tau)=G_S(g tau) => W(gA)=W(A)/g, Vmax scales by g => ratio fixed.
  CONSEQUENCE: WLOG gcd(S)=1 (primitive). [But primitivity does NOT bound speeds.]

